<title>UK: Societe Generale appoints new head of UK sales.</title>
<headline>Societe Generale appoints new head of UK sales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale said on Thursday it has appointed Hugh de Lusignan as Head of UK Product Sales and Marketing worldwide for equities and derivatives.</p>
<p>Societe Generale said de Lusignan would take up the position by the end of this year.</p>
<p>The bank said de Lusignan was joining Societe Generale from NatWest Markets, where was was head of UK equity sales.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
